        "body": [
          {
            "control": "raw",
            "react": "<ContextMenu groups={groups} accessibleLabel={label} locale={locale} direction={direction} className=\"hl-gallery-menu-trigger\">\n  <div data-context-trigger tabIndex={0} className=\"hl-gallery-record\">\n    <strong>{pseudo ? '⟦ Îñšþëçţîøñ 42 ···· ⟧' : arabic ? 'الفحص 42' : 'Inspection 42'}</strong>\n    <span>{pseudo ? '⟦ Řîĝhţ-çļîçķ øř Þřëšš Šhîƒţ+F10 ······ ⟧' : arabic ? 'انقر بزر الماوس الأيمن أو اضغط Shift+F10' : 'Right-click or press Shift+F10'}</span>\n  </div>\n</ContextMenu>",
            "blazor": "<HarborlineContextMenu Groups=\"Groups\" AccessibleLabel=\"@AccessibleLabel\" Locale=\"@Locale\" Direction=\"@Direction\" Class=\"hl-gallery-menu-trigger\">\n    <div data-context-trigger tabindex=\"0\" class=\"hl-gallery-record\">\n        <strong>@RecordTitle</strong>\n        <span>@Instruction</span>\n    </div>\n</HarborlineContextMenu>",
            "rationale": "The closed descriptor vocabulary has no context-menu, menu-item, separator, disabled-item, danger-item, icon, or focusable custom-trigger control, so it cannot express the grouped menu and its trigger relationship without losing rendered structure and behavior."
          }
